TATTOO ARTIST

Tattoo artists are special NPCs who can permanently ink tattoos onto your body
for a fee. They offer a selection of pre-designed tattoos with various animals
and colors that provide stat bonuses.

<g>FINDING TATTOO ARTISTS<1>
Tattoo artists can be found in various cities throughout the world.
Look for NPCs with "tattoo artist" in their description or name.

<g>PURCHASING TATTOOS<1>
Syntax: list
        buy <animal> <color> <body location>

- LIST shows available animals and colors you can choose from
- BUY creates a custom tattoo with your chosen animal and color
- Cost: 100000 talens per tattoo
- You must have enough money before purchasing

<g>BODY LOCATIONS<1>
Valid locations include:
  head, neck, body, arm, hand, foot, etc.

Note: Most tattoo artists refuse to tattoo legs due to policy.

<g>RESTRICTIONS<1>
- You cannot have multiple tattoos on the same body slot
- You must have the required body part (no tattooing missing limbs)
- You need 100000 talens for each tattoo
- Tattoos are permanent once applied

<g>AVAILABLE OPTIONS<1>
Tattoo artists can create custom tattoos featuring:
- Single stat animals: lion, bear, snake, eagle, etc.
- Dual stat animals: dragon, tiger, monkey, wolf, etc.
- Various colors: blue, purple, green, yellow, grey, red, white, black

Each combination provides different stat bonuses based on the animal and color.
See HELP TATTOO STATS for complete bonus information.

<g>EXAMPLES<1>
buy dragon blue arm      - "A tattoo of a raging blue dragon zooming about"
                         - "A tattoo of a swift blue dragon flexing wildly"
buy kangaroo yellow foot - "A tattoo of a charming yellow kangaroo looking fast"
                         - "A tattoo of a sprightly yellow kangaroo winking coyishly"

Note: Adjectives and action phrases are independently and randomly selected
from the animal's available stats, creating unique combinations!

<g>CUSTOM TATTOOS<1>
Immortals can create custom tattoos using the BESTOW command.
Players cannot design their own tattoos through normal gameplay.

